#. Description of the plugin
#: gatecha-captcha.php
msgid "Self-hosted ALTCHA proof-of-work CAPTCHA via GateCHA. Protects WordPress forms without cookies, fingerprinting, or third-party services."
msgstr "Selbst gehostetes ALTCHA-Proof-of-Work-CAPTCHA über GateCHA. Schützt WordPress-Formulare ohne Cookies, Fingerprinting oder Drittanbieterdienste."

